<h2 id="strings">Strings<a class="anchor" href="#strings" aria-label="Link to this section">#</a></h2>

<p><code>Pop\Utils\Str</code> is static, and the piece you reach for most is case conversion. The method names are
dynamic — <code>Str::&lt;from&gt;To&lt;To&gt;()</code> — across seven forms: TitleCase, camelCase, kebab-case (also spelled
<code>Dash</code>), snake_case (also spelled <code>Underscore</code>), <code>Name\Space</code>, <code>folder/path</code>, and <code>url/path</code> (also
spelled <code>Uri</code>).</p>
